<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Ishpreet Kaur | Dispatch Executive</title>

<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:wght@300;400;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

<style>

*{
margin:0;
padding:0;
box-sizing:border-box;
scroll-behavior:smooth;
font-family:'Poppins',sans-serif;
}

body{
background:#0f172a;
color:white;
}

.hero{
height:100vh;
background:
linear-gradient(rgba(0,0,0,.60),rgba(0,0,0,.60)),
url("IMG_4996.jpeg");
background-size:cover;
background-position:center;
display:flex;
align-items:center;
padding:0 10%;
}

.hero-content{
max-width:700px;
}

.hero h1{
font-size:70px;
font-weight:700;
line-height:1.1;
}

.hero h2{
margin-top:10px;
font-size:28px;
font-weight:500;
color:#d1d5db;
}

.hero p{
margin-top:25px;
font-size:18px;
line-height:1.8;
color:#f3f4f6;
}

.buttons{
margin-top:35px;
display:flex;
gap:20px;
}

.btn{
padding:15px 35px;
border-radius:40px;
text-decoration:none;
font-weight:600;
transition:.3s;
}

.primary{
background:#f59e0b;
color:black;
}

.secondary{
border:2px solid white;
color:white;
}

.btn:hover{
transform:translateY(-3px);
}

section{
padding:90px 10%;
}

.title{
font-size:40px;
margin-bottom:40px;
text-align:center;
}

.card{
background:rgba(255,255,255,.08);
backdrop-filter:blur(16px);
border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.1);
border-radius:20px;
padding:35px;
margin-bottom:30px;
}

.card h3{
margin-bottom:15px;
font-size:26px;
}

.card p{
line-height:1.9;
color:#d6d6d6;
}

.grid{
display:grid;
grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(250px,1fr));
gap:25px;
}

.skill{
padding:20px;
background:rgba(255,255,255,.07);
border-radius:15px;
text-align:center;
font-weight:600;
}

footer{
padding:60px 10%;
text-align:center;
background:#020617;
}

footer h2{
margin-bottom:20px;
}

footer p{
margin:8px 0;
color:#d1d5db;
}

@media(max-width:768px){

.hero h1{
font-size:46px;
}

.hero h2{
font-size:22px;
}

.buttons{
flex-direction:column;
}

.title{
font-size:32px;
}

}

</style>

</head>

<body>

<section class="hero">

<div class="hero-content">

<h1>Ishpreet Kaur</h1>

<h2>Dispatch Executive • Operations Coordinator</h2>

<p>

Dedicated professional with 3 years of experience at Rai Arts, Mullanpur.
Experienced in printing workflow, order coordination, production management,
documentation and dispatch support. Looking for an opportunity to grow
in the logistics and dispatch industry.

</p>

