I am Ishpreet Kaur, a hardworking and organized professional with three years
of experience working at Rai Arts, a printing firm based in Mullanpur.
My work has involved handling print-ready designs, coordinating customer
orders, assisting production teams, maintaining records, and ensuring
timely dispatch of completed jobs.

I am now seeking opportunities as a Dispatch Executive where I can apply
my organizational skills, communication abilities, and operational experience.

</p>

